/S /P
/E (Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) is increasingly being applied to solve everyday societal challenges by enabling machines to perform tasks that require human-like intelligence. Within this domain, deep learning has emerged as a powerful technique in computer vision, allowing systems to automatically recognize, classify, and analyze visual data for improved decision-making.)
/Pg 11 0 R
