155 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In the existing system, researchers proposed an artificial intelligence multitier framework with a lightweight classifier for helmetless biker detection. Their method follows a two-stage process: first detecting motorbike riders from traffic footage, and then classifying whether they are wearing helmets.By designing a lightweight model, the system reduces computational cost, enabling faster detection with acceptable accuracy. The authors also built custom datasets to train and evaluate the system under different conditions. While this approach achieved promising results, it primarily addressed only helmet detection and was tested under limited scenarios.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
